sequenceDiagram
    participant P as Processor
    participant C as SocketControl
    participant S as Socket task
    participant B as ProSA bus

    P->>C: control_channel(settings)
    P->>S: spawn(control receiver, queue)
    S->>B: add_proc_queue(queue id)
    S-->>S: serve until the connection ends

    Note over P,C: Configuration reload
    P->>C: update(settings)
    C-->>S: read on the next attempt or tick

    Note over P,S: The connection ended
    S->>B: remove_proc_queue(queue id)
    S-->>P: hand the socket back
    P->>S: spawn again after Backoff::delay(retry)

    Note over P,C: The slot is gone from the configuration
    P->>C: stop()
    C-->>S: stopped() resolves
    S-->>P: hand the socket back
    P->>S: retire_queue(queue)
    S-->>B: answer UnableToReachService until the last sender is gone
